{"steam_appid":3905450,"steam_name":"WheelMates","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3905450/1579115703/5e529a7a94971d6f8cf50c4f660759071696acba/1788268320/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1788273990","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257397358/f45358fa955d828a0c78289bbdfc2f06b7e0afb7/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1788273990","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/9c0ec73aea243c21099e1033cc3ad2bc6f7da2a2/ss_9c0ec73aea243c21099e1033cc3ad2bc6f7da2a2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788429316","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/cd223ca755765f6d98aecdd41cfd70adff7ba4d9/ss_cd223ca755765f6d98aecdd41cfd70adff7ba4d9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788429316","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/d202741d3613bd044ad3f753deafeebb8763d307/ss_d202741d3613bd044ad3f753deafeebb8763d307.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788429316","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/43391abb4d9188545f3abcf9ea460f037f922beb/ss_43391abb4d9188545f3abcf9ea460f037f922beb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788429316","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/94c01d7b1d2e2702dc2db95a8e7986427f7a540a/ss_94c01d7b1d2e2702dc2db95a8e7986427f7a540a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1788429316"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You and a friend answer a call for help from a professor who has mysteriously disappeared. Take control of two tiny RC cars, drive through his maze-like home laboratory, overcome oversized obstacles, and uncover the strange experiments he left behind.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/df544c536c6efe1818f5dbc210ee607f.poster.avif?t=1788429316\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/df544c536c6efe1818f5dbc210ee607f.webm?t=1788429316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/df544c536c6efe1818f5dbc210ee607f.mp4?t=1788429316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room turns the house into a playground for two tiny RC cars. Race across shelves, drift through cluttered desks, explore every location and piece together what really happened inside.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/4a099f717fd2b704ba9f6f6bb0d513de.poster.avif?t=1788429316\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/4a099f717fd2b704ba9f6f6bb0d513de.webm?t=1788429316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/4a099f717fd2b704ba9f6f6bb0d513de.mp4?t=1788429316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this co-op journey your progress depends on working together. Solve puzzles and overcome challenges that require communication, timing, and both players doing their part.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/ae48c55aaefb84aae1fc54a29d0e2625.poster.avif?t=1788429316\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/ae48c55aaefb84aae1fc54a29d0e2625.webm?t=1788429316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/ae48c55aaefb84aae1fc54a29d0e2625.mp4?t=1788429316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your RC cars with rope-swings, magnetic wheels, magnet grabs and other power-ups. Each new gadget opens up fresh way to exploration of the professor’s home.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/e2266d452c43a00b12dbf8f26afd3868.poster.avif?t=1788429316\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/e2266d452c43a00b12dbf8f26afd3868.webm?t=1788429316\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3905450/extras/e2266d452c43a00b12dbf8f26afd3868.mp4?t=1788429316\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The house keeps opening up as you progress. Unlock hidden rooms and move through familiar places in new ways. </p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64 bit Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 2600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 / AMD RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64 bit Windows 10/11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i7-10700K / AMD Ryzen 7 3700X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 3060 / AMD RX 6600 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Adventure","Indie","Racing"],"developers":["Firevolt"],"publishers":["Firevolt"],"release_date":"Sep 1, 2026"}